+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386), which is simpler than JSON Patch. The toolkit has no way to apply one.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing the RFC 7386 MergePatch algorithm and returning the merged document as a new value.
+- Document it in `README.md`.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+`src/index.ts`, `src/index.test.ts`, `README.md`. No new dependencies; existing exports are unchanged.
